WEBVTT

00:10:29.905 --> 00:10:35.187
We are faced with the moral imperative,
and the practical urgency,

00:10:35.211 --> 00:10:38.308
to rethink many things:

00:10:38.332 --> 00:10:42.676
the way we produce; the way we consume;

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:45.916
our culture of waste;

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:48.396
our short-term vision;

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:50.601
the exploitation of the poor

00:10:50.625 --> 00:10:54.056
and our indifference towards them;

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:56.877
the growing inequalities

00:10:56.901 --> 00:11:00.918
and our dependence
on harmful energy sources.